_vrf_DIFMN02_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: The minimum difference density is < -0.1*ZMAX*1.00
RESPONSE: Due to the teflon sheath used in the saftey containment protocol, see SI
;
_vrf_PLAT971_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: Check Calcd Resid. Dens. 1.28Ang From Cs9 5.64 eA-3
RESPONSE: High residual Q-peaks common near heavy atoms, see SI
;
_vrf_PLAT972_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: Check Calcd Resid. Dens. 0.36Ang From Cm1 -9.34 eA-3
RESPONSE: High residual Q-peaks common near heavy atoms, see SI
;
_vrf_PLAT975_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: Check Calcd Resid. Dens. 0.67Ang From O81 . 2.69 eA-3
RESPONSE: High residual Q-peaks common near heavy atoms, see SI
;
_vrf_PLAT098_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: Large Reported Min. (Negative) Residual Density -9.68 eA-3
RESPONSE: High residual Q-peaks common near heavy atoms, see SI
;
_vrf_PLAT306_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: Isolated Oxygen Atom (H-atoms Missing ?) ....... O5 Check
RESPONSE: Solvent waters, H-atoms could not be found
;
_vrf_PLAT910_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: Missing # of FCF Reflection(s) Below Theta(Min). 46 Note
RESPONSE: Due to beamstop shadow, see SI
;
_vrf_PLAT934_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: Number of (Iobs-Icalc)/Sigma(W) > 10 Outliers .. 2 Check
RESPONSE: ...
;
_vrf_PLAT973_cmsiw11-cs          
;
PROBLEM: Check Calcd Positive Resid. Density on W8 1.89 eA-3
RESPONSE: High residual Q-peaks common near heavy atoms, see SI
;
# end Validation Reply Form

